<title>PHILIPPINES: Metrobank declares two-peso cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Metrobank declares two-peso cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Bank and Trust Co (Metrobank) has declared a two-peso cash dividend, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>No record date has yet been set for the cash dividend.</p>
<p>So for this year, Metrobank had granted a two-peso cash dividend in the second quarter.</p>
<p>In 1995, its cash dividends totalled 5 pesos and stock dividends at 25 percent.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
